{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108220","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108220","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1910822001:1":{"text":"浅海……是什么样子？是不是……水很暖和，很明亮？是不是有很多食物，不会饿肚子？","source_cn":"浅海……是什么样子？是不是……水很暖和，很明亮？是不是...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x50E8B5129C1AE390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910822002:1":{"text":"有很多很多家人……都住在一起。真的吗？","source_cn":"有很多很多家人……都住在一起。真的吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB6144291B3397D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910822003:1":{"text":"嗯，浅海很美、很明亮、很暖和，也有很多好吃的，大家生活在一起，是整个海里最好最好的地方。","source_cn":"嗯，浅海很美、很明亮、很暖和，也有很多好吃的，大家生活...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1FF9A95B0E3BF8E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910822004:1":{"text":"哥哥也是这样讲给我听的。他说，要让我去一个很大、很漂亮的地方生活。","source_cn":"哥哥也是这样讲给我听的。他说，要让我去一个很大、很漂亮...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x49B7CEB50AC3286B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910822005:1":{"text":"在那里，你会好起来，不再生病，不再受声音的折磨。","source_cn":"在那里，你会好起来，不再生病，不再受声音的折磨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCACBD6EA4CB2161A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910822006:1":{"text":"哥哥，我没关系的，我想回家……我们回家吧。","source_cn":"哥哥，我没关系的，我想回家……我们回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FBF84B1B7D07689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910822007:1":{"text":"你听到的声音变弱了吗？","source_cn":"你听到的声音变弱了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FDDA96BE06E2226","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910822008:1":{"text":"不……它一直都在，我听得很清楚。","source_cn":"不……它一直都在，我听得很清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE7C938FBFEDB952","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910822009:1":{"text":"但是哥哥……你不用再担心我了。","source_cn":"但是哥哥……你不用再担心我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBD47A313DD1C34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910822010:1":{"text":"什么？","source_cn":"什么？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x78EF7F3418F734B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910822011:1":{"text":"因为我到家了。","source_cn":"因为我到家了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64